Package: fernet
Title: Fernet Symmetric Encryption for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jared", "Park", , "PJared722@gmail.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the Fernet symmetric encryption scheme, providing
    functions to generate keys, and to encrypt and decrypt messages using
    AES-CBC with HMAC-SHA256 authentication, encoded as URL-safe base64
    tokens.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    digest,
    lubridate,
    openssl
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
